    <section id="exp_1" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 1: LIBRARY MANAGEMENT SYSTEM</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">1. A local library needs a website to streamline operations and enhance user 

experience. The site will include a catalog for searching and viewing books, user 

accounts for borrowing and managing books, and an admin dashboard for 

managing inventory and user data. Essential features include a search function, 

book details page, user login system, and contact form, The system helps both 

students and library managers to keep constant track of all the books available in 

the library. It allows both the admin and the student to search for the desired book. 

It becomes necessary for colleges to keep a continuous check on the books issued 

and returned and even calculate fines.

Librarian Admin:

• Login

• Add Book

• Update/Delete Book

• Issue Book for student

• Return Book Status

• Make Fine

• Update material ( year, semester wise )

• View material

User

• Login

• Register

• Search Book

• My Borrow History Book

o Issue Date, Exp Date

• Check Fine

• Search material ( year, semester wise )

• Download material

• My profile</div>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To design, develop and test a responsive web-based library management system utilizing HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Library Management System&lt;/title&gt;&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;&lt;header&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Library Management System&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Search books, view details, student login/register demo, borrow book, borrowing history, fine estimate, study materials and contact form.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;nav&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#features&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#main&quot;&gt;Explore / Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#records&quot;&gt;My dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#admin&quot;&gt;Admin demo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;main&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hero&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Welcome&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a responsive front-end lab demonstration based on Experiment 01. Use the forms to try the workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;HTML · CSS · JavaScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;features&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Catalog&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Search and browse books by title, author or category. Borrowing and admin actions are demo interactions saved in this browser.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Student account&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Register or sign in locally, view borrow history and profile.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Admin dashboard&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Add books and update availability in this browser.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;main&quot; style=&quot;display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:20px&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Book catalogue&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Search books&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;search&quot; placeholder=&quot;Search title or author&quot; oninput=&quot;filterBooks()&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Category&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;category&quot; onchange=&quot;filterBooks()&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;All&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Programming&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Science&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Literature&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;bookList&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Student registration / login demo&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;demoForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Student name&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Your name&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Book / profile detail&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Book title or username&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Borrow request&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Save demo record&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;records&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;My dashboard / saved records&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;records&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;actions&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;resetDemo()&quot;&gt;Clear demo data&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;admin&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Admin panel (front-end demo)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Administrative changes below are stored only in this browser. No real account or server is connected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;adminForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Item / setting&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Service, room, bus, product, schedule...&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Details / updated value&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Enter details&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Admin update&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Save admin update&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;notice warning&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; This is a client-side academic demonstration. Real authentication, database storage, live inventory, payment gateway, email/SMS notifications and production security require a server and trusted service integrations. Do not enter real passwords or payment details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Internet Programming Lab · Experiment 01 · Responsive HTML/CSS/JavaScript demo&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>
:root{--ink:#25223a;--muted:#6d6a7d;--brand:#7654c8;--brand2:#f1eaff;--bg:#f7f5fb;--card:#fff;--line:#e7e2f0;--good:#16865b;--danger:#c33d52}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}
header{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#38266d,#7957c9);color:white;padding:26px max(5vw,20px)}
header h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,36px)}header p{margin:0;color:#eee7ff;max-width:850px}
nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #ffffff55;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px}
main{max-width:1120px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}.hero{background:var(--brand2);padding:22px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(245px,1fr));gap:16px}.card,section.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #33205b0a}
h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
form{display:grid;gap:10px}label{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#514d62}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d8d2e4;border-radius:9px;font:inherit;background:white;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:75px}button,.button{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 15px;background:var(--brand);color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#eee9f8;color:#4a367f}button.danger{background:var(--danger)}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#eee9f8;color:#523a91;font-size:12px}
.item{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px;border-radius:11px;margin:9px 0;background:#fff}.item p{margin:5px 0}.price{font-weight:bold;color:var(--good)}.notice{padding:11px;border-radius:9px;background:#edf8f2;color:#176847;margin:10px 0}.warning{background:#fff5e8;color:#8a5512}
footer{text-align:center;padding:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:22px 18px}main{margin:18px auto}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>
const KEY = &quot;LAB_DEMO_library&quot;;
function readData(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY))||{records:[],extra:[]}}catch(e){return {records:[],extra:[]}}}
function saveData(d){localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(d))}
function escapeHTML(s){return String(s??&quot;&quot;).replace(/[&amp;&lt;&gt;&quot;&#x27;]/g,c=&gt;({&quot;&amp;&quot;:&quot;&amp;amp;&quot;,&quot;&lt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;lt;&quot;,&quot;&gt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;gt;&quot;,&#x27;&quot;&#x27;:&quot;&amp;quot;&quot;,&quot;&#x27;&quot;:&quot;&amp;#39;&quot;}[c]))}
function showMessage(msg){const el=document.getElementById(&quot;message&quot;);if(el)el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;notice&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(msg)+&#x27;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;}
function renderRecords(){const d=readData(),el=document.getElementById(&quot;records&quot;);if(!el)return;
 if(!d.records.length){el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;No records yet. Add a demo entry using the form.&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;;return}
 el.innerHTML=d.records.map((r,i)=&gt;&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.title)+&#x27;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.detail||&quot;&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.status||&quot;Saved&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;removeRecord(&#x27;+i+&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Remove&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;).join(&#x27;&#x27;)
}
function addRecord(title,detail,status=&quot;Saved&quot;){const d=readData();d.records.unshift({title,detail,status,created:new Date().toISOString()});saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function removeRecord(i){const d=readData();d.records.splice(i,1);saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function resetDemo(){if(confirm(&quot;Clear all locally saved demo data for this experiment?&quot;)){localStorage.removeItem(KEY);renderRecords();showMessage(&quot;Demo data cleared.&quot;)}}
document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{renderRecords();const f=document.getElementById(&quot;demoForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(f);addRecord(fd.get(&quot;title&quot;),fd.get(&quot;detail&quot;),fd.get(&quot;status&quot;)||&quot;Saved&quot;);f.reset();showMessage(&quot;Saved in this browser only.&quot;)})})

const books=[[&quot;HTML and CSS&quot;,&quot;Programming&quot;,&quot;Available&quot;],[&quot;Python Basics&quot;,&quot;Programming&quot;,&quot;Available&quot;],[&quot;Data Science&quot;,&quot;Science&quot;,&quot;Issued&quot;],[&quot;Short Stories&quot;,&quot;Literature&quot;,&quot;Available&quot;]];
function filterBooks(){const q=(document.getElementById(&quot;search&quot;).value||&quot;&quot;).toLowerCase(),c=document.getElementById(&quot;category&quot;).value;document.getElementById(&quot;bookList&quot;).innerHTML=books.filter(b=&gt;(c===&quot;All&quot;||b[1]===c)&amp;&amp;b.join(&quot; &quot;).toLowerCase().includes(q)).map(b=&gt;&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;&#x27;+b[0]+&#x27;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+b[1]+&#x27; · &#x27;+b[2]+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;).join(&quot;&quot;)||&quot;&lt;p&gt;No books found.&lt;/p&gt;&quot;}
document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,filterBooks);
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
            <div class="result-box">
                The webpage for <strong>Library Management System</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section id="exp_2" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 2: HOTEL ROOM BOOKING</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">2. The online hotel room booking website allows users to search for hotels based on destination, 

dates, and number of guests, offering detailed listings with room options, prices, amenities, and 

reviews. Users can create accounts, log in, and manage their bookings through a user-friendly 

dashboard. The booking process includes checking room availability, filling out a booking form, 

and completing secure payments via an integrated payment gateway. Post-booking, users 

receive confirmation emails and can leave reviews and ratings. Admins manage hotel listings, 

room availability, and user accounts through a dedicated admin panel. The website is fully 


responsive, ensuring seamless access on all devices.

Functionalities:

Users.

1. Users can register at the hotel and then they can view or modify their profile.

2. Users can book a room on any specific date.

3. Users can view all their booking history at the hotel.

4. Users can change the booking at any time 3 days before the arrival date.

5. Users can cancel the booking at any time 3 days before the arrival date.

6. Users can check the room availability at the hotel before they book a room.

Administrator

7. Administrators can change the quantity and price of all four types of rooms.

8. Administrators can change any specific booking details.

9. Administrators can cancel any specific booking.

10. Administrators can modify the details of static pages including room information, about us

information, contact us information, customer service Q&amp;A details, local travel and shipping

guide, and privacy policy after login.

11. It should also contain a basic room type introduction, contact information, customer service

Q&amp;A, local travel and shipping guide, and a privacy policy</div>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To design, develop and test a responsive web-based hotel room booking utilizing HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Hotel Room Booking&lt;/title&gt;&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;&lt;header&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Hotel Room Booking&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Search hotels/rooms by destination, dates and guests; view room types, amenities, prices and reviews; make, edit or cancel demo bookings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;nav&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#features&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#main&quot;&gt;Explore / Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#records&quot;&gt;My dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#admin&quot;&gt;Admin demo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;main&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hero&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Welcome&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a responsive front-end lab demonstration based on Experiment 02. Use the forms to try the workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;HTML · CSS · JavaScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;features&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Room availability&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Choose check-in/check-out dates and guest count to see sample room options.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Guest dashboard&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Create demo bookings, view history, and reschedule or cancel subject to the three-day-before-arrival rule.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Admin panel&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Adjust sample room prices and quantities.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;main&quot; style=&quot;display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:20px&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Find a room&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;searchForm&quot; class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Destination&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;destination&quot; required placeholder=&quot;City or hotel&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Check-in&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;checkin&quot; type=&quot;date&quot; required&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Check-out&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;checkout&quot; type=&quot;date&quot; required&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Guests&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;guests&quot; type=&quot;number&quot; min=&quot;1&quot; value=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;button&gt;Search rooms&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;searchResults&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Make a demo booking&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;demoForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Guest / hotel / room type&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Guest - Deluxe Room&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Booking dates and details&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Destination, check-in and check-out&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Booking request&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Book room (demo)&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;records&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;My dashboard / saved records&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;records&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;actions&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;resetDemo()&quot;&gt;Clear demo data&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;admin&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Admin panel (front-end demo)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Administrative changes below are stored only in this browser. No real account or server is connected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;adminForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Item / setting&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Service, room, bus, product, schedule...&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Details / updated value&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Enter details&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Admin update&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Save admin update&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;notice warning&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; This is a client-side academic demonstration. Real authentication, database storage, live inventory, payment gateway, email/SMS notifications and production security require a server and trusted service integrations. Do not enter real passwords or payment details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Internet Programming Lab · Experiment 02 · Responsive HTML/CSS/JavaScript demo&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>
:root{--ink:#25223a;--muted:#6d6a7d;--brand:#7654c8;--brand2:#f1eaff;--bg:#f7f5fb;--card:#fff;--line:#e7e2f0;--good:#16865b;--danger:#c33d52}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}
header{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#38266d,#7957c9);color:white;padding:26px max(5vw,20px)}
header h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,36px)}header p{margin:0;color:#eee7ff;max-width:850px}
nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #ffffff55;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px}
main{max-width:1120px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}.hero{background:var(--brand2);padding:22px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(245px,1fr));gap:16px}.card,section.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #33205b0a}
h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
form{display:grid;gap:10px}label{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#514d62}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d8d2e4;border-radius:9px;font:inherit;background:white;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:75px}button,.button{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 15px;background:var(--brand);color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#eee9f8;color:#4a367f}button.danger{background:var(--danger)}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#eee9f8;color:#523a91;font-size:12px}
.item{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px;border-radius:11px;margin:9px 0;background:#fff}.item p{margin:5px 0}.price{font-weight:bold;color:var(--good)}.notice{padding:11px;border-radius:9px;background:#edf8f2;color:#176847;margin:10px 0}.warning{background:#fff5e8;color:#8a5512}
footer{text-align:center;padding:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:22px 18px}main{margin:18px auto}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>
const KEY = &quot;LAB_DEMO_hotel&quot;;
function readData(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY))||{records:[],extra:[]}}catch(e){return {records:[],extra:[]}}}
function saveData(d){localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(d))}
function escapeHTML(s){return String(s??&quot;&quot;).replace(/[&amp;&lt;&gt;&quot;&#x27;]/g,c=&gt;({&quot;&amp;&quot;:&quot;&amp;amp;&quot;,&quot;&lt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;lt;&quot;,&quot;&gt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;gt;&quot;,&#x27;&quot;&#x27;:&quot;&amp;quot;&quot;,&quot;&#x27;&quot;:&quot;&amp;#39;&quot;}[c]))}
function showMessage(msg){const el=document.getElementById(&quot;message&quot;);if(el)el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;notice&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(msg)+&#x27;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;}
function renderRecords(){const d=readData(),el=document.getElementById(&quot;records&quot;);if(!el)return;
 if(!d.records.length){el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;No records yet. Add a demo entry using the form.&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;;return}
 el.innerHTML=d.records.map((r,i)=&gt;&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.title)+&#x27;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.detail||&quot;&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.status||&quot;Saved&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;removeRecord(&#x27;+i+&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Remove&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;).join(&#x27;&#x27;)
}
function addRecord(title,detail,status=&quot;Saved&quot;){const d=readData();d.records.unshift({title,detail,status,created:new Date().toISOString()});saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function removeRecord(i){const d=readData();d.records.splice(i,1);saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function resetDemo(){if(confirm(&quot;Clear all locally saved demo data for this experiment?&quot;)){localStorage.removeItem(KEY);renderRecords();showMessage(&quot;Demo data cleared.&quot;)}}
document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{renderRecords();const f=document.getElementById(&quot;demoForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(f);addRecord(fd.get(&quot;title&quot;),fd.get(&quot;detail&quot;),fd.get(&quot;status&quot;)||&quot;Saved&quot;);f.reset();showMessage(&quot;Saved in this browser only.&quot;)})})

document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{const f=document.getElementById(&quot;searchForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const box=document.getElementById(&quot;searchResults&quot;);const from=document.getElementById(&quot;from&quot;)?.value||document.getElementById(&quot;destination&quot;)?.value||&quot;Your destination&quot;;const to=document.getElementById(&quot;to&quot;)?.value||&quot;&quot;;box.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample result&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(from)+&#x27; &#x27;+(to?&#x27; → &#x27;+escapeHTML(to):&#x27;&#x27;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demo availability · Indicative details only&lt;/p&gt;&lt;button onclick=&quot;showMessage(\&#x27;Select this sample option and complete the booking form below.\&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Select&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alternative sample option&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demo inventory only&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;})});
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
            <div class="result-box">
                The webpage for <strong>Hotel Room Booking</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section id="exp_3" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 3: BUS TICKET BOOKING</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">3. The online bus ticket booking system enables users to search for buses by route, date, and time, 

and view available seats. Users can create an account, log in, and manage their bookings 

through a personal dashboard. The booking process includes selecting seats, filling out 

passenger details, and making secure payments via an integrated payment gateway. Admins 

can manage bus schedules, seat availability, and user accounts through an admin panel. Users 

receive booking confirmation emails and can view their booking history. The website is mobile￾responsive, ensuring easy access on all devices.

Admin

In this system, the admin can maintain all the Bus information and maintain Bus category,

comments etc.

In this system, the admin can maintain the registered users, manage news, and the admin cangenerate

reports and manage the whole system.

Login:

Login Module includes various utilities like User Authentication, Change Password and Forgot


Password.

Registration:

This website provides some facilities users can be Registered in this website. user can use thisfacility

so user can make a registration

.

Book the Ticket:

In this module, the admin can add a new bus category using this module. Bus Category contains

like Volvo, Slipper coach, coach etc.

Update Bus Information:

In this module, the admin can add or Update Bus using this module. It contains information

about the Bus type, photo, description, Location of the tour, Available Seats in Bus etc.

Cancel the Booking Ticket:

In this Module, the User can cancel the booking Ticket.

Comments:

In this Module, Users can Post Comments on a particular Bus.

Report Generation:

This module is used to generate a report.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To design, develop and test a responsive web-based bus ticket booking utilizing HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Bus Ticket Booking&lt;/title&gt;&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;&lt;header&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Bus Ticket Booking&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Search buses by route and date, view seat availability, choose seats, enter passenger details, confirm a demo ticket and view bookings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;nav&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#features&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#main&quot;&gt;Explore / Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#records&quot;&gt;My dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#admin&quot;&gt;Admin demo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;main&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hero&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Welcome&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a responsive front-end lab demonstration based on Experiment 03. Use the forms to try the workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;HTML · CSS · JavaScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;features&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Bus search&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Search by origin, destination and journey date.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Seat selection&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Select seats and enter passenger details.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Admin tools&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Add/update sample bus information and view a simple report.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;main&quot; style=&quot;display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:20px&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Search buses&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;searchForm&quot; class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;From&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;from&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Chennai&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;To&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;to&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Coimbatore&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Journey date&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;journey&quot; type=&quot;date&quot; required&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;button&gt;Find buses&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;searchResults&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Passenger and seat booking&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;demoForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Passenger / bus&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Passenger name - Bus name&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Seat numbers and route&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Seats 3, 4; Chennai to Coimbatore&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Ticket booked (demo)&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Confirm demo ticket&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;records&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;My dashboard / saved records&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;records&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;actions&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;resetDemo()&quot;&gt;Clear demo data&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;admin&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Admin panel (front-end demo)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Administrative changes below are stored only in this browser. No real account or server is connected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;adminForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Item / setting&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Service, room, bus, product, schedule...&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Details / updated value&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Enter details&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Admin update&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Save admin update&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;notice warning&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; This is a client-side academic demonstration. Real authentication, database storage, live inventory, payment gateway, email/SMS notifications and production security require a server and trusted service integrations. Do not enter real passwords or payment details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Internet Programming Lab · Experiment 03 · Responsive HTML/CSS/JavaScript demo&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>
:root{--ink:#25223a;--muted:#6d6a7d;--brand:#7654c8;--brand2:#f1eaff;--bg:#f7f5fb;--card:#fff;--line:#e7e2f0;--good:#16865b;--danger:#c33d52}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}
header{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#38266d,#7957c9);color:white;padding:26px max(5vw,20px)}
header h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,36px)}header p{margin:0;color:#eee7ff;max-width:850px}
nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #ffffff55;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px}
main{max-width:1120px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}.hero{background:var(--brand2);padding:22px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(245px,1fr));gap:16px}.card,section.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #33205b0a}
h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
form{display:grid;gap:10px}label{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#514d62}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d8d2e4;border-radius:9px;font:inherit;background:white;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:75px}button,.button{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 15px;background:var(--brand);color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#eee9f8;color:#4a367f}button.danger{background:var(--danger)}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#eee9f8;color:#523a91;font-size:12px}
.item{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px;border-radius:11px;margin:9px 0;background:#fff}.item p{margin:5px 0}.price{font-weight:bold;color:var(--good)}.notice{padding:11px;border-radius:9px;background:#edf8f2;color:#176847;margin:10px 0}.warning{background:#fff5e8;color:#8a5512}
footer{text-align:center;padding:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:22px 18px}main{margin:18px auto}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>
const KEY = &quot;LAB_DEMO_bus&quot;;
function readData(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY))||{records:[],extra:[]}}catch(e){return {records:[],extra:[]}}}
function saveData(d){localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(d))}
function escapeHTML(s){return String(s??&quot;&quot;).replace(/[&amp;&lt;&gt;&quot;&#x27;]/g,c=&gt;({&quot;&amp;&quot;:&quot;&amp;amp;&quot;,&quot;&lt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;lt;&quot;,&quot;&gt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;gt;&quot;,&#x27;&quot;&#x27;:&quot;&amp;quot;&quot;,&quot;&#x27;&quot;:&quot;&amp;#39;&quot;}[c]))}
function showMessage(msg){const el=document.getElementById(&quot;message&quot;);if(el)el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;notice&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(msg)+&#x27;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;}
function renderRecords(){const d=readData(),el=document.getElementById(&quot;records&quot;);if(!el)return;
 if(!d.records.length){el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;No records yet. Add a demo entry using the form.&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;;return}
 el.innerHTML=d.records.map((r,i)=&gt;&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.title)+&#x27;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.detail||&quot;&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.status||&quot;Saved&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;removeRecord(&#x27;+i+&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Remove&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;).join(&#x27;&#x27;)
}
function addRecord(title,detail,status=&quot;Saved&quot;){const d=readData();d.records.unshift({title,detail,status,created:new Date().toISOString()});saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function removeRecord(i){const d=readData();d.records.splice(i,1);saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function resetDemo(){if(confirm(&quot;Clear all locally saved demo data for this experiment?&quot;)){localStorage.removeItem(KEY);renderRecords();showMessage(&quot;Demo data cleared.&quot;)}}
document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{renderRecords();const f=document.getElementById(&quot;demoForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(f);addRecord(fd.get(&quot;title&quot;),fd.get(&quot;detail&quot;),fd.get(&quot;status&quot;)||&quot;Saved&quot;);f.reset();showMessage(&quot;Saved in this browser only.&quot;)})})

document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{const f=document.getElementById(&quot;searchForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const box=document.getElementById(&quot;searchResults&quot;);const from=document.getElementById(&quot;from&quot;)?.value||document.getElementById(&quot;destination&quot;)?.value||&quot;Your destination&quot;;const to=document.getElementById(&quot;to&quot;)?.value||&quot;&quot;;box.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample result&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(from)+&#x27; &#x27;+(to?&#x27; → &#x27;+escapeHTML(to):&#x27;&#x27;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demo availability · Indicative details only&lt;/p&gt;&lt;button onclick=&quot;showMessage(\&#x27;Select this sample option and complete the booking form below.\&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Select&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alternative sample option&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demo inventory only&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;})});
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
            <div class="result-box">
                The webpage for <strong>Bus Ticket Booking</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
