    <section id="exp_5" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 5: FLIGHT RESERVATION SYSTEM</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">5. The online flight reservation system enables users to search for flights by 

destination, date, and class, displaying available options with real-time seat availability. 

Users can register, log in, and manage their reservations via a personal dashboard. The

booking process includes selecting flights, choosing seats, entering passenger details, and 

making secure payments through an integrated payment gateway. Admins can manage 

flight schedules, seat inventory, and user accounts using an advanced admin panel. Users 

receive booking confirmation emails with e-tickets and can view their booking history and 


travel itineraries. The website is fully responsive, ensuring an optimal experience on all 

devices.The airline reservation system is a web-based system that helps in consolidating 

flight data - flight schedules, seat availability, flight fares and reservations from all 

airlines with the help of global distribution systems and provides real-time inventory and 

rates for customers and travel agents to book flight tickets online.

• Administrator User Login Page

• Forgot Password Page

• Search Flight Page

• Book Ticket Page

• Ticket Payment Page

• My Ticket Page

• Cancel Ticket Page

• Customer Feedback

• Admin Report

• Search Flight Page

• View Booking Status Page

• Print Ticket Page</div>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To design, develop and test a responsive web-based flight reservation system utilizing HTML5, CSS3, and JavaScript.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Flight Reservation System&lt;/title&gt;&lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;&lt;header&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Flight Reservation System&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;Search flights by destination, date and class; choose seats; enter passenger details; create demo e-ticket; view, print or cancel bookings.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;nav&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#features&quot;&gt;Features&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#main&quot;&gt;Explore / Book&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#records&quot;&gt;My dashboard&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;#admin&quot;&gt;Admin demo&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/nav&gt;&lt;/header&gt;
&lt;main&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;hero&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Welcome&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is a responsive front-end lab demonstration based on Experiment 05. Use the forms to try the workflow.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;HTML · CSS · JavaScript&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;features&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Key features&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Flight search&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Search sample flights with indicative fares and seat counts.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Booking&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Select a flight and seat, then create a local demo booking.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;article class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;My tickets&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;View, print and cancel locally stored demo tickets.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/article&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;main&quot; style=&quot;display:grid;gap:16px;margin-top:20px&quot;&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Search flights&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;searchForm&quot; class=&quot;grid&quot;&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;From&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;from&quot; required&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Destination&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;to&quot; required&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Date&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input id=&quot;journey&quot; type=&quot;date&quot; required&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;label&gt;Class&lt;/label&gt;&lt;select id=&quot;class&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Economy&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Premium Economy&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Business&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;button&gt;Search flights&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;searchResults&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section class=&quot;panel&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Passenger and ticket&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;demoForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Passenger / flight&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Passenger name - Flight number&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Seat and travel details&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Seat 12A, route and date&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;E-ticket (demo)&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Book demo flight&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;records&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;My dashboard / saved records&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div id=&quot;records&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;actions&quot;&gt;&lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;resetDemo()&quot;&gt;Clear demo data&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;section id=&quot;admin&quot; class=&quot;panel&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:18px&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Admin panel (front-end demo)&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;Administrative changes below are stored only in this browser. No real account or server is connected.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;form id=&quot;adminForm&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Item / setting&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;title&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Service, room, bus, product, schedule...&quot;&gt;&lt;label&gt;Details / updated value&lt;/label&gt;&lt;input name=&quot;detail&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Enter details&quot;&gt;&lt;input type=&quot;hidden&quot; name=&quot;status&quot; value=&quot;Admin update&quot;&gt;&lt;button&gt;Save admin update&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/form&gt;&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;message&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;notice warning&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Important:&lt;/strong&gt; This is a client-side academic demonstration. Real authentication, database storage, live inventory, payment gateway, email/SMS notifications and production security require a server and trusted service integrations. Do not enter real passwords or payment details.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/main&gt;&lt;footer&gt;Internet Programming Lab · Experiment 05 · Responsive HTML/CSS/JavaScript demo&lt;/footer&gt;&lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;&lt;/body&gt;&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>
:root{--ink:#25223a;--muted:#6d6a7d;--brand:#7654c8;--brand2:#f1eaff;--bg:#f7f5fb;--card:#fff;--line:#e7e2f0;--good:#16865b;--danger:#c33d52}
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);line-height:1.5}
header{background:linear-gradient(120deg,#38266d,#7957c9);color:white;padding:26px max(5vw,20px)}
header h1{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:clamp(24px,4vw,36px)}header p{margin:0;color:#eee7ff;max-width:850px}
nav{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:18px}nav a{color:white;text-decoration:none;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid #ffffff55;border-radius:20px;font-size:14px}
main{max-width:1120px;margin:26px auto;padding:0 18px}.hero{background:var(--brand2);padding:22px;border-radius:16px;margin-bottom:20px}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(245px,1fr));gap:16px}.card,section.panel{background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;padding:18px;box-shadow:0 5px 20px #33205b0a}
h2{font-size:21px;margin:0 0 12px}h3{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:18px}.muted{color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
form{display:grid;gap:10px}label{font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;color:#514d62}input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:11px;border:1px solid #d8d2e4;border-radius:9px;font:inherit;background:white;color:var(--ink)}
textarea{min-height:75px}button,.button{border:0;border-radius:9px;padding:11px 15px;background:var(--brand);color:white;font-weight:bold;cursor:pointer}button.secondary{background:#eee9f8;color:#4a367f}button.danger{background:var(--danger)}button:disabled{opacity:.45;cursor:not-allowed}
.actions{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:12px}.tag{display:inline-block;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:20px;background:#eee9f8;color:#523a91;font-size:12px}
.item{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:13px;border-radius:11px;margin:9px 0;background:#fff}.item p{margin:5px 0}.price{font-weight:bold;color:var(--good)}.notice{padding:11px;border-radius:9px;background:#edf8f2;color:#176847;margin:10px 0}.warning{background:#fff5e8;color:#8a5512}
footer{text-align:center;padding:28px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}
table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}td,th{text-align:left;padding:9px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:14px}
@media(max-width:600px){header{padding:22px 18px}main{margin:18px auto}.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>
const KEY = &quot;LAB_DEMO_flight&quot;;
function readData(){try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY))||{records:[],extra:[]}}catch(e){return {records:[],extra:[]}}}
function saveData(d){localStorage.setItem(KEY,JSON.stringify(d))}
function escapeHTML(s){return String(s??&quot;&quot;).replace(/[&amp;&lt;&gt;&quot;&#x27;]/g,c=&gt;({&quot;&amp;&quot;:&quot;&amp;amp;&quot;,&quot;&lt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;lt;&quot;,&quot;&gt;&quot;:&quot;&amp;gt;&quot;,&#x27;&quot;&#x27;:&quot;&amp;quot;&quot;,&quot;&#x27;&quot;:&quot;&amp;#39;&quot;}[c]))}
function showMessage(msg){const el=document.getElementById(&quot;message&quot;);if(el)el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;notice&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(msg)+&#x27;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;}
function renderRecords(){const d=readData(),el=document.getElementById(&quot;records&quot;);if(!el)return;
 if(!d.records.length){el.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;p class=&quot;muted&quot;&gt;No records yet. Add a demo entry using the form.&lt;/p&gt;&#x27;;return}
 el.innerHTML=d.records.map((r,i)=&gt;&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.title)+&#x27;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.detail||&quot;&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;tag&quot;&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(r.status||&quot;Saved&quot;)+&#x27;&lt;/span&gt; &lt;button class=&quot;secondary&quot; onclick=&quot;removeRecord(&#x27;+i+&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Remove&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;).join(&#x27;&#x27;)
}
function addRecord(title,detail,status=&quot;Saved&quot;){const d=readData();d.records.unshift({title,detail,status,created:new Date().toISOString()});saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function removeRecord(i){const d=readData();d.records.splice(i,1);saveData(d);renderRecords()}
function resetDemo(){if(confirm(&quot;Clear all locally saved demo data for this experiment?&quot;)){localStorage.removeItem(KEY);renderRecords();showMessage(&quot;Demo data cleared.&quot;)}}
document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{renderRecords();const f=document.getElementById(&quot;demoForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const fd=new FormData(f);addRecord(fd.get(&quot;title&quot;),fd.get(&quot;detail&quot;),fd.get(&quot;status&quot;)||&quot;Saved&quot;);f.reset();showMessage(&quot;Saved in this browser only.&quot;)})})

document.addEventListener(&quot;DOMContentLoaded&quot;,()=&gt;{const f=document.getElementById(&quot;searchForm&quot;);if(f)f.addEventListener(&quot;submit&quot;,e=&gt;{e.preventDefault();const box=document.getElementById(&quot;searchResults&quot;);const from=document.getElementById(&quot;from&quot;)?.value||document.getElementById(&quot;destination&quot;)?.value||&quot;Your destination&quot;;const to=document.getElementById(&quot;to&quot;)?.value||&quot;&quot;;box.innerHTML=&#x27;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Sample result&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;&#x27;+escapeHTML(from)+&#x27; &#x27;+(to?&#x27; → &#x27;+escapeHTML(to):&#x27;&#x27;)+&#x27;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demo availability · Indicative details only&lt;/p&gt;&lt;button onclick=&quot;showMessage(\&#x27;Select this sample option and complete the booking form below.\&#x27;)&quot;&gt;Select&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;item&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alternative sample option&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;Demo inventory only&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&#x27;})});
</code></pre>
        </div>

