        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">13. BlossomGifts, a user-friendly online platform, offers a seamless experience for ordering 

flowers and gifts for any occasion. The website features a diverse selection of floral 

arrangements, gift baskets, and personalized gifts, all organized by occasion, recipient, 

and price range. Key functionalities include user registration and login, a customizable 

order system with options for delivery dates and times, and detailed product descriptions 

with high-quality images. Customers can track their orders in real-time, schedule future 

deliveries, and receive order confirmations via email or SMS. The platform also supports 

secure payment methods and provides special promotions and discounts for loyal 

customers. BlossomGifts aims to make sending thoughtful gifts and flowers easy and 

convenient, ensuring timely delivery and customer satisfaction.

➢ The key to helping customers find the products they need quickly is to offer a user￾friendly navigation system.

➢ Products should be logically categorized, with the most popular categories listed first.

➢ Display all the available categories for shopping on the home page.

➢ Display all the subcategories on the home page, that are associated with any particular

item.

➢ Admin has the authority to add new particulars to the items list whenever needed.

➢ Permission to the administrator to remove items, anytime.

➢ Allows the admin to modify the price of each item, whenever required or felt like.

➢ Permission to the admin to view information about each customer who checkouts the

items list.

Use Cases

Edit (Change, Delete) Customer Info

Inquire about ... via email

Maintain (add, change, delete) Inventory

View Order Summary

Visit a site

Login Search for Items

Check Availability of Items

Add Items to Shopping Cart

Edit Items in the Shopping Cart

remove Items from the Shopping Cart

Check out the Shopping Cart

Check Order Status

Browse Order History

Display Item Details

Logout

Leave a site</div>
        </div>

