        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To engineer an online car and bike rental platform with dynamic tariff calculator, duration picker, security deposit tracking, and booking vouchers.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;RentRide - Self-Drive Cars &amp; Bikes&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;🚗 Rent&lt;span&gt;Ride&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Affordable Self-Drive &amp;amp; Chauffeur Rentals&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;booking-widget&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;form-row&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;label&gt;Pickup City&lt;/label&gt;
                    &lt;select id=&quot;rentCity&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Chennai&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Coimbatore&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Bangalore&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;label&gt;Rental Duration (Days)&lt;/label&gt;
                    &lt;input type=&quot;number&quot; id=&quot;rentDays&quot; value=&quot;2&quot; min=&quot;1&quot; max=&quot;30&quot; onchange=&quot;calcTotal()&quot;&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;label&gt;Driver Option&lt;/label&gt;
                    &lt;select id=&quot;driverOpt&quot; onchange=&quot;calcTotal()&quot;&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Self Drive (₹0)&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option value=&quot;500&quot;&gt;With Driver (+₹500/day)&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;div id=&quot;fleetGrid&quot; class=&quot;fleet-grid&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { background: #f8fafc; color: #0f172a; }
.header { background: #0f172a; color: white; padding: 18px 6%; text-align: center; }
.header span { color: #f59e0b; }
.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.booking-widget { background: white; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06); margin-bottom: 24px; }
.form-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #475569; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
input, select { width: 100%; padding: 8px 10px; border: 1.5px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 6px; }
.fleet-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 18px; }
.car-card { background: white; border-radius: 8px; padding: 18px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; }
.car-type { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; }
.car-price { font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 800; color: #0f172a; margin: 10px 0; }
.btn { padding: 9px 16px; background: #f59e0b; color: #0f172a; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; width: 100%; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; background: #0f172a; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; display: none; }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>const fleet = [
    { id: 1, name: &#x27;Hyundai i20&#x27;, type: &#x27;Hatchback (Petrol)&#x27;, rate: 1400, deposit: 2000 },
    { id: 2, name: &#x27;Honda City&#x27;, type: &#x27;Sedan (Automatic)&#x27;, rate: 2200, deposit: 3000 },
    { id: 3, name: &#x27;Mahindra Scorpio-N&#x27;, type: &#x27;SUV (7-Seater Diesel)&#x27;, rate: 3200, deposit: 4000 },
    { id: 4, name: &#x27;Royal Enfield Classic 350&#x27;, type: &#x27;Cruiser Bike&#x27;, rate: 850, deposit: 1500 }
];
function showToast(m) { const t = document.getElementById(&#x27;toast&#x27;); t.innerText = m; t.style.display = &#x27;block&#x27;; setTimeout(() =&gt; t.style.display = &#x27;none&#x27;, 2200); }
function calcTotal() { renderFleet(); }
function renderFleet() {
    const days = parseInt(document.getElementById(&#x27;rentDays&#x27;).value) || 1;
    const driver = parseInt(document.getElementById(&#x27;driverOpt&#x27;).value) || 0;
    const grid = document.getElementById(&#x27;fleetGrid&#x27;);
    grid.innerHTML = &#x27;&#x27;;
    fleet.forEach(v =&gt; {
        const total = (v.rate + driver) * days;
        grid.innerHTML += `
            &lt;div class=&quot;car-card&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;span class=&quot;car-type&quot;&gt;${v.type}&lt;/span&gt;
                    &lt;h3&gt;${v.name}&lt;/h3&gt;
                    &lt;p style=&quot;font-size:0.85rem; color:#64748b;&quot;&gt;Refundable Deposit: ₹${v.deposit}&lt;/p&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;car-price&quot;&gt;₹${total} &lt;small style=&quot;font-size:0.8rem; font-weight:normal;&quot;&gt;for ${days} days&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;button class=&quot;btn&quot; onclick=&quot;bookRide(&#x27;${v.name}&#x27;, ${total})&quot;&gt;Book Vehicle Now&lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        `;
    });
}
function bookRide(name, total) {
    showToast(`✓ Booking confirmed for ${name}! Voucher generated. Total: ₹${total}`);
}
window.addEventListener(&#x27;DOMContentLoaded&#x27;, renderFleet);</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
            <div class="result-box">
                The webpage for <strong>RentRide Vehicle Rental Platform</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
