    <section id="exp_22" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 22: SMARTWASTE MUNICIPAL SOLID WASTE MANAGEMENT</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">22. Solid waste management can be broadly categorized as segregation, collection, and

