        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">23. The blood management information system offers functionality to quick access to donor

records collected from various parts of the country. It enables monitoring of the results 

and performance of the blood donation activity such that relevant and measurable 

objectives of the organization can be checked. It provides to management timely,

confidential and securemedical reports that facilitates planning and decision making and 

hence improved medical service delivery. The reports generated by the system give 

