                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;art-card&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div class=&quot;art-placeholder&quot; style=&quot;background:#bae6fd;&quot;&gt;🌊&lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;h4&gt;Azure Stillness&lt;/h4&gt;
