        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">30. The International Journal of Scientific and Social Excellence (IJSSE) has launched a 

professional and user-friendly website to facilitate its operations as a Scopus-indexed journal 

publisher. The website features an &quot;About Journal&quot; section detailing its mission, scope, and the 

significance of its print ISSN 2395-1443 and online ISSN 2395-1451. Key menus include &quot;For 

Authors,&quot; where contributors can submit manuscripts, track submission status, and access 

guidelines; &quot;For Reviewers,&quot; which provides tools for reviewing submissions and accessing 

reviewer resources; and &quot;For Editors,&quot; offering a dashboard for managing submissions, 

coordinating peer reviews, and overseeing publication processes. The site also includes registration 

options for authors, reviewers, and editors, ensuring seamless communication and workflow. The 

IJSSE website aims to support a streamlined submission and review process, enhancing the 

efficiency and transparency of academic publishing.

1) Home page 

2) About Journal 

3) Publication ethics 

4) Editorial board 

