        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To construct an e-commerce and subscription web portal for farm-fresh dairy products, managing recurring morning milk deliveries and farm transparency practices.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Ko-Matha - Farm Fresh A2 Milk &amp; Dairy&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;🐄 Ko-Matha &lt;span&gt;Smart Dairy&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;100% Pure Grass-Fed A2 Desi Cow Milk &amp;amp; Traditional Dairy Products&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Start Daily Morning Milk Subscription&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;form onsubmit=&quot;subscribeMilk(event)&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Delivery Name *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;subName&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Customer Full Name&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Contact Phone *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;input type=&quot;tel&quot; id=&quot;subPhone&quot; required pattern=&quot;[0-9]{10}&quot; placeholder=&quot;9876543210&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Daily Milk Quantity *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;select id=&quot;subLitres&quot; onchange=&quot;calcMonthlyCost()&quot;&gt;
                            &lt;option value=&quot;1&quot;&gt;1 Litre / Day (₹75/day)&lt;/option&gt;
                            &lt;option value=&quot;2&quot; selected&gt;2 Litres / Day (₹150/day)&lt;/option&gt;
                            &lt;option value=&quot;3&quot;&gt;3 Litres / Day (₹225/day)&lt;/option&gt;
                        &lt;/select&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Delivery Time Slot *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;select id=&quot;subSlot&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Early Morning (05:30 AM - 06:30 AM)&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Morning (06:30 AM - 07:30 AM)&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div&gt;
                    &lt;label&gt;Full Delivery Address *&lt;/label&gt;
                    &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;subAddress&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Flat No, Apartment, Street...&quot;&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div style=&quot;margin-top:12px; font-weight:bold; color:#15803d;&quot;&gt;
                    Estimated Monthly Total: &lt;span id=&quot;subTotal&quot;&gt;₹4,500&lt;/span&gt; (30 Days)
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-primary&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:12px;&quot;&gt;Activate Daily Delivery Subscription&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/form&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { background: #f7fee7; color: #14532d; }
.header { background: #166534; color: white; padding: 18px 6%; text-align: center; }
.header span { color: #fde047; }
.container { max-width: 860px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.card { background: white; padding: 22px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #dcfce7; }
.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #166534; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
input, select { width: 100%; padding: 9px; border: 1.5px solid #bbf7d0; border-radius: 6px; }
.btn-primary { width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #166534; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; background: #166534; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; display: none; }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>function showToast(m) { const t = document.getElementById(&#x27;toast&#x27;); t.innerText = m; t.style.display = &#x27;block&#x27;; setTimeout(() =&gt; t.style.display = &#x27;none&#x27;, 2500); }
function calcMonthlyCost() {
    const l = parseInt(document.getElementById(&#x27;subLitres&#x27;).value);
    document.getElementById(&#x27;subTotal&#x27;).innerText = &#x27;₹&#x27; + (l * 75 * 30).toLocaleString(&#x27;en-IN&#x27;);
}
function subscribeMilk(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    showToast(&#x27;✓ Ko-Matha subscription activated! Morning deliveries start tomorrow.&#x27;);
    e.target.reset();
}</code></pre>
        </div>

