and mission, a &quot;Contact&quot; page for customer support, and a &quot;FAQ&quot; section addressing common 

queries. Ram Infotech’s website aims to provide a seamless experience for both acquiring and 

maintaining laptops, ensuring quality service and customer satisfaction.

1) Admin detail – Login, Registration form detail

