        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To construct an interactive hill-station dining discovery and table reservation platform with cuisine filters and pre-order menus.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;KodaikanalEats - Hill Station Restaurant Booking&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;🍲 Kodaikanal&lt;span&gt;Eats&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Book Tables &amp;amp; Special Dining Across Scenic Hill Cafes &amp;amp; Restaurants&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Reserve a Scenic Table&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;form onsubmit=&quot;bookTable(event)&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Select Restaurant *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;select id=&quot;restSelect&quot;&gt;
                            &lt;option&gt;Cloud Street Cafe (Italian &amp; Woodfired Pizza)&lt;/option&gt;
                            &lt;option&gt;Tava Hillside (Authentic Indian &amp; Tawa Specialties)&lt;/option&gt;
                            &lt;option&gt;Tibetan Brothers (Misty Valley Momos &amp; Thukpa)&lt;/option&gt;
                        &lt;/select&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Seating Preference *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;select id=&quot;seatPref&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Outdoor Valley View Terrace&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Cozy Indoor Fireplace&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Private Garden Cabana&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Date &amp;amp; Time *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;input type=&quot;datetime-local&quot; id=&quot;bookDateTime&quot; required&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Number of Guests *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;input type=&quot;number&quot; id=&quot;guestCount&quot; value=&quot;2&quot; min=&quot;1&quot; max=&quot;15&quot; required&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-primary&quot;&gt;Confirm Table Reservation&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/form&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { background: #fff7ed; color: #7c2d12; }
.header { background: #c2410c; color: white; padding: 18px 6%; text-align: center; }
.header span { color: #fde047; }
.container { max-width: 860px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.card { background: white; padding: 22px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #ffedd5; }
.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #9a3412; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
input, select { width: 100%; padding: 9px; border: 1.5px solid #fed7aa; border-radius: 6px; }
.btn-primary { width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #c2410c; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; background: #c2410c; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; display: none; }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>function showToast(m) { const t = document.getElementById(&#x27;toast&#x27;); t.innerText = m; t.style.display = &#x27;block&#x27;; setTimeout(() =&gt; t.style.display = &#x27;none&#x27;, 2500); }
function bookTable(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    const rest = document.getElementById(&#x27;restSelect&#x27;).value;
    const guests = document.getElementById(&#x27;guestCount&#x27;).value;
    showToast(`✓ Table reserved for ${guests} guests at ${rest}! Confirmation token sent.`);
    e.target.reset();
}</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
            <div class="result-box">
                The webpage for <strong>KodaikanalEats Restaurant Dining Platform</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
