        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;LearnWell Tuition Centre - Academic Excellence&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;🎓 Learn&lt;span&gt;Well&lt;/span&gt; Tuition Centre&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Comprehensive Coaching for Classes 9-12 &amp;amp; Competitive Entrance&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Student Batch Enrollment&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;form onsubmit=&quot;enrollStudent(event)&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Student Full Name *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;studName&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Student Name&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Academic Grade *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;select id=&quot;studGrade&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Class 9&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Class 10 (Board Exam)&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Class 11&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option selected&gt;Class 12 (Board &amp;amp; JEE/NEET)&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Subject Focus Batch *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;select id=&quot;studSubj&quot;&gt;&lt;option&gt;Advanced Mathematics &amp;amp; Physics&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Chemistry &amp;amp; Biology&lt;/option&gt;&lt;option&gt;Computer Science &amp;amp; Python&lt;/option&gt;&lt;/select&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                    &lt;div&gt;
                        &lt;label&gt;Parent Contact Mobile *&lt;/label&gt;
                        &lt;input type=&quot;tel&quot; id=&quot;parentPhone&quot; required pattern=&quot;[0-9]{10}&quot; placeholder=&quot;9876543210&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-primary&quot;&gt;Enroll &amp;amp; Schedule Free Demo Class&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/form&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { background: #fdf2f8; color: #831843; }
.header { background: #9d174d; color: white; padding: 18px 6%; text-align: center; }
.header span { color: #fbcfe8; }
.container { max-width: 860px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.card { background: white; padding: 22px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #fce7f3; }
.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
label { font-size: 0.8rem; font-weight: 700; color: #9d174d; display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; }
input, select { width: 100%; padding: 9px; border: 1.5px solid #fbcfe8; border-radius: 6px; }
.btn-primary { width: 100%; padding: 10px; background: #9d174d; color: white; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; background: #9d174d; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; display: none; }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>function showToast(m) { const t = document.getElementById(&#x27;toast&#x27;); t.innerText = m; t.style.display = &#x27;block&#x27;; setTimeout(() =&gt; t.style.display = &#x27;none&#x27;, 2500); }
function enrollStudent(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    const name = document.getElementById(&#x27;studName&#x27;).value.trim();
