            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;EduConnect - Interactive E-Learning&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;📚 Edu&lt;span&gt;Connect&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Interactive Computer Science &amp;amp; Full-Stack Development Academy&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;div class=&quot;course-player&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;video-mock&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div style=&quot;font-size:4rem;&quot;&gt;▶&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;p&gt;Lesson 4: Building Asynchronous REST APIs with AJAX &amp;amp; JSON&lt;/p&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;syllabus-list&quot;&gt;
                &lt;h3&gt;Course Curriculum&lt;/h3&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;cur-item active&quot;&gt;1. HTML5 Semantic Controls (Completed)&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;cur-item active&quot;&gt;2. CSS3 Grid &amp;amp; Flexbox Mastery (Completed)&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;cur-item active&quot;&gt;3. JavaScript DOM &amp;amp; RegEx Validation (Completed)&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;cur-item&quot;&gt;4. AJAX &amp;amp; Web Services Communication (Now Playing)&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;cur-item&quot;&gt;5. Capstone Project Architecture (Next)&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { background: #0f172a; color: white; }
.header { background: #1e293b; padding: 18px 6%; text-align: center; border-bottom: 1px solid #334155; }
.header span { color: #38bdf8; }
.container { max-width: 1000px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.course-player { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }
.video-mock { background: black; border-radius: 8px; height: 380px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border: 1px solid #334155; color: #94a3b8; }
.syllabus-list { background: #1e293b; padding: 20px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #334155; }
.cur-item { padding: 10px; border-radius: 6px; margin-bottom: 8px; font-size: 0.88rem; background: #0f172a; cursor: pointer; }
.cur-item.active { background: #0284c7; color: white; font-weight: bold; }
@media(max-width:700px){ .course-player { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>document.querySelectorAll(&#x27;.cur-item&#x27;).forEach(item =&gt; {
    item.addEventListener(&#x27;click&#x27;, () =&gt; {
        document.querySelectorAll(&#x27;.cur-item&#x27;).forEach(i =&gt; i.classList.remove(&#x27;active&#x27;));
        item.classList.add(&#x27;active&#x27;);
    });
});</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
