                The webpage for <strong>EduConnect Online Learning Platform</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
    
    <section id="exp_37" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 37: BOOKHAVEN ONLINE BOOKSTORE</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">36. &quot;BookHaven&quot; is a sleek and user-friendly online bookstore designed to provide a comprehensive and 

enjoyable shopping experience for book lovers. The homepage features a visually appealing layout with 

curated book collections, bestsellers, and new arrivals. Key static pages include an &quot;About Us&quot; section that 

