    <section id="exp_39" class="exp-section">
        <div class="exp-header">
            <h2>EXPERIMENT 39: GOURMET HAVEN FINE DINING RESTAURANT</h2>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>1. PROBLEM STATEMENT (QUESTION)</h4>
            <div class="question-box">38. Gourmet Haven is a sophisticated website designed to enhance the digital presence of a fictional 

fine dining restaurant. It features a striking home page with a rotating carousel of the restaurant&#x27;s 

ambiance and signature dishes, an interactive menu showcasing detailed descriptions and pricing, 

and an easy-to-use reservation system for booking tables. The site includes an &quot;About Us&quot; page 

detailing the restaurant&#x27;s history and culinary team, a gallery of high-resolution images capturing 

the dining experience, and a contact page with essential information and a contact form. Gourmet 

Haven aims to provide an engaging and user-friendly online experience, allowing potential 

customers to explore offerings, make reservations, and connect with the restaurant effortlessly

1.Homepage:

• Create an engaging and visually appealing homepage that reflects the restaurant&#x27;s theme and 

atmosphere.

• Include high-quality images of the restaurant&#x27;s interior, exterior, and signature dishes.

• Add a welcoming message or tagline to set the tone for the dining experience.

2.Menu Pages:

• Develop dedicated pages for the restaurant&#x27;s menu items, organized by categories (appetizers, main 

courses, desserts, etc.).

• Include detailed descriptions of each dish, including ingredients and pricing.

• Integrate high-resolution images of the dishes to entice visitors.

• Implement navigation to easily switch between different menu categories.

3.Contact Information:

• Create a separate page for contact information, including the restaurant&#x27;s physical address, phone 

number, and email address.

• Embed an interactive Google Maps widget displaying the restaurant&#x27;s location.

• Include a contact form to allow customers to submit inquiries, reservations, or feedback.

4.Reservation System:

• If desired, implement an online reservation system that allows visitors to book a table.

• Include a calendar for selecting dates and times, along with the number of guests.

5.About Us Page:

• Develop a page that provides background information about the restaurant, such as its history, 

concept, and culinary philosophy.

• Include images of the chef and the kitchen staff, along with their brief bios.

6.Special Offers and Events:

• If applicable, create a section for special promotions, events, or seasonal menus.

• Include details of ongoing deals, happy hours, or upcoming celebrations.

7.Testimonials and Reviews:

• If available, showcase customer testimonials and reviews to build trust and credibility.

• Include snippets of feedback from satisfied patrons.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To construct an interactive fine dining culinary website featuring hero carousels, dietary-tagged menu cards, and online table reservations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;Gourmet Haven - Modern Fine Dining&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;Gourmet &lt;span&gt;Haven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Contemporary Culinary Artistry &amp;amp; Artisan Tasting Menus&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Reserve a Chef&#x27;s Table&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;form onsubmit=&quot;reserveGourmet(event)&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;row&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;gName&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Guest Name&quot;&gt;
                    &lt;input type=&quot;datetime-local&quot; id=&quot;gTime&quot; required&gt;
                    &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; class=&quot;btn&quot;&gt;Reserve Table&lt;/button&gt;
                &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/form&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:20px;&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Seasonal Tasting Menu&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;menu-grid&quot;&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;menu-item&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Truffle Risotto&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Arborio rice, wild morels, aged parmesan&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;₹850&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;menu-item&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Pan-Seared Sea Bass&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Saffron foam, buttered asparagus&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;₹1,200&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
                &lt;div class=&quot;menu-item&quot;&gt;&lt;h4&gt;Belgian Dark Fondant&lt;/h4&gt;&lt;p&gt;Warm molten center, vanilla bean gelato&lt;/p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;₹450&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: &#x27;Georgia&#x27;, serif; }
body { background: #1c1917; color: #f5f5f4; }
.header { text-align: center; padding: 36px 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #44403c; }
.header span { color: #f59e0b; }
.container { max-width: 860px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.card { background: #292524; padding: 22px; border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid #44403c; }
.row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 2fr 2fr 1fr; gap: 10px; }
input { padding: 9px; background: #1c1917; border: 1px solid #57534e; color: white; border-radius: 4px; }
.btn { background: #f59e0b; color: #1c1917; border: none; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }
.menu-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-top: 14px; }
.menu-item { background: #1c1917; padding: 14px; border-radius: 4px; border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b; }
.menu-item p { font-size: 0.8rem; color: #a8a29e; margin: 4px 0; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; background: #f59e0b; color: #1c1917; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 4px; display: none; font-weight: bold; }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>function showToast(m) { const t = document.getElementById(&#x27;toast&#x27;); t.innerText = m; t.style.display = &#x27;block&#x27;; setTimeout(() =&gt; t.style.display = &#x27;none&#x27;, 2500); }
function reserveGourmet(e) { e.preventDefault(); showToast(&#x27;✓ Table reserved at Gourmet Haven! Confirmation token dispatched.&#x27;); e.target.reset(); }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
            <div class="result-box">
                The webpage for <strong>Gourmet Haven Fine Dining Restaurant</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
            </div>
        </div>
