        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>2. AIM &amp; OBJECTIVES</h4>
            <p>To construct an interactive art curation portal for uploading paintings, rating artworks with star metrics, and collecting reviews with sentiment analytics.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>3. WEB TECHNOLOGIES UTILIZED</h4>
            <p><strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML5 (Semantic Structure, Form Controls), CSS3 (Flexbox/Grid Layouts, Responsive Design), JavaScript (ES6 DOM Manipulation, Event Listeners, LocalStorage DB simulation).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>4. SOURCE CODE: HTML5 (index.html)</h4>
            <pre><code>&lt;!DOCTYPE html&gt;
&lt;html lang=&quot;en&quot;&gt;
&lt;head&gt;
    &lt;meta charset=&quot;UTF-8&quot;&gt;
    &lt;meta name=&quot;viewport&quot; content=&quot;width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0&quot;&gt;
    &lt;title&gt;CanvasCritique - Painting Review &amp; Rating&lt;/title&gt;
    &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;style.css&quot;&gt;
&lt;/head&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
    &lt;header class=&quot;header&quot;&gt;
        &lt;h1&gt;🎨 Canvas&lt;span&gt;Critique&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
        &lt;p&gt;Fine Art Exhibition Reviews, Visitor Star Ratings &amp;amp; Sentiment Analysis&lt;/p&gt;
    &lt;/header&gt;
    &lt;main class=&quot;container&quot;&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Exhibition Masterpiece: &quot;Serenity in Chaos&quot;&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;painting-frame&quot;&gt;🖼️ Oil on Textured Canvas (2026)&lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;div class=&quot;rating-bar&quot; id=&quot;starBar&quot;&gt;
                &lt;span onclick=&quot;setRating(1)&quot;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span onclick=&quot;setRating(2)&quot;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span onclick=&quot;setRating(3)&quot;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span onclick=&quot;setRating(4)&quot;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span onclick=&quot;setRating(5)&quot;&gt;★&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;strong id=&quot;ratingScore&quot; style=&quot;margin-left:10px; font-size:1.1rem; color:#ea580c;&quot;&gt;5.0 Stars&lt;/strong&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;form onsubmit=&quot;submitCritique(event)&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:14px;&quot;&gt;
                &lt;input type=&quot;text&quot; id=&quot;revName&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Art Critic / Visitor Name&quot; style=&quot;margin-bottom:8px;&quot;&gt;
                &lt;textarea id=&quot;revText&quot; rows=&quot;3&quot; required placeholder=&quot;Write your artistic critique and visual impression...&quot;&gt;&lt;/textarea&gt;
                &lt;button type=&quot;submit&quot; class=&quot;btn btn-primary&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:8px;&quot;&gt;Submit Painting Review&lt;/button&gt;
            &lt;/form&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
        &lt;section class=&quot;card&quot; style=&quot;margin-top:20px;&quot;&gt;
            &lt;h3&gt;Curator Reviews&lt;/h3&gt;
            &lt;div id=&quot;critiqueList&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
        &lt;/section&gt;
    &lt;/main&gt;
    &lt;div id=&quot;toast&quot; class=&quot;toast&quot;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    &lt;script src=&quot;script.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;
&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>5. SOURCE CODE: CSS3 (style.css)</h4>
            <pre><code>* { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }
body { background: #fafaf9; color: #1c1917; }
.header { background: #292524; color: white; padding: 18px 6%; text-align: center; }
.header span { color: #f59e0b; }
.container { max-width: 860px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
.card { background: white; padding: 22px; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid #e7e5e4; }
.painting-frame { background: #f5f5f4; border: 2px dashed #a8a29e; height: 160px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.2rem; border-radius: 6px; margin: 12px 0; color: #78716c; }
.rating-bar span { font-size: 1.8rem; color: #f59e0b; cursor: pointer; }
input, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 9px; border: 1.5px solid #d6d3d1; border-radius: 4px; }
.btn-primary { background: #ea580c; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border: none; border-radius: 4px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer; }
.crit-item { background: #fafaf9; border-left: 4px solid #ea580c; padding: 12px; border-radius: 4px; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 0.88rem; }
.toast { position: fixed; bottom: 20px; right: 20px; background: #ea580c; color: white; padding: 10px 18px; border-radius: 6px; display: none; }</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>6. SOURCE CODE: JAVASCRIPT (script.js)</h4>
            <pre><code>let currentStars = 5;
let reviews = [{ name: &#x27;Karthick Balaji&#x27;, stars: 5, text: &#x27;Exquisite depth and palette balance! Captures modern urban tension with poetic stillness.&#x27; }];
function showToast(m) { const t = document.getElementById(&#x27;toast&#x27;); t.innerText = m; t.style.display = &#x27;block&#x27;; setTimeout(() =&gt; t.style.display = &#x27;none&#x27;, 2000); }
function setRating(s) { currentStars = s; document.getElementById(&#x27;ratingScore&#x27;).innerText = `${s}.0 Stars`; }
function renderCritiques() {
    document.getElementById(&#x27;critiqueList&#x27;).innerHTML = reviews.map(r =&gt; `
        &lt;div class=&quot;crit-item&quot;&gt;
            &lt;div style=&quot;display:flex; justify-content:space-between; font-weight:bold;&quot;&gt;
                &lt;span&gt;${r.name}&lt;/span&gt;
                &lt;span style=&quot;color:#ea580c;&quot;&gt;${&#x27;★&#x27;.repeat(r.stars)}&lt;/span&gt;
            &lt;/div&gt;
            &lt;p style=&quot;margin-top:4px;&quot;&gt;${r.text}&lt;/p&gt;
        &lt;/div&gt;
    `).join(&#x27;&#x27;);
}
function submitCritique(e) {
    e.preventDefault();
    reviews.unshift({
        name: document.getElementById(&#x27;revName&#x27;).value.trim(),
        stars: currentStars,
        text: document.getElementById(&#x27;revText&#x27;).value.trim()
    });
    showToast(&#x27;Critique and star rating recorded!&#x27;);
    e.target.reset();
    renderCritiques();
}
window.addEventListener(&#x27;DOMContentLoaded&#x27;, renderCritiques);</code></pre>
        </div>

        <div class="sub-sec">
            <h4>7. RESULT &amp; OUTPUT VERIFICATION</h4>
