                The webpage for <strong>Painting Review &amp; Rating System</strong> was successfully designed, developed and validated across multiple screen dimensions. All interactive modules (user registration/booking, form data validation, local storage retrieval, and responsive UI components) executed as expected with zero runtime errors.
